# Positive-control injection for hints-CompressedChecksummedDataInput-readBuffer-uncompressedSize--autonomous, cluster tier (audit
# amendment R11). Loaded alone on node A of an `inject` lifetime: -javaagent:<byteman jar>=listener:true,port:9113,sys:<HuControl jar>,script:<this file>
# Every 10 s HintsDispatchTrigger.run() fires; when <flagdir>/inject exists the node's chunk-cache pool serves and holds 400 x 64 KiB
# (HuControl.inject), when <flagdir>/release exists they are given back.

RULE hu control inject
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.hints.HintsDispatchTrigger
METHOD run
AT ENTRY
IF HuControl.flag("inject")
DO HuControl.inject()
ENDRULE

RULE hu control release
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.hints.HintsDispatchTrigger
METHOD run
AT ENTRY
IF HuControl.flag("release")
DO HuControl.release()
ENDRULE
